WEBVTT

00:21:26.913 --> 00:21:33.871
Yes, because I don't think you can make
decisions without there being endorsed

00:21:33.871 --> 00:21:37.288
by your intuitions. You have
to feel conviction.

00:21:38.204 --> 00:21:42.579
You have to feel that there is some good
reason to be doing what you are doing,

00:21:42.871 --> 00:21:46.246
so ultimately intuition must be involved.

00:21:46.746 --> 00:21:52.371
But if it's involved, if if you
jump to conclusions too early

00:21:52.413 --> 00:21:59.163
or jump to decisions too early, then you
are going to make avoidable mistakes.